WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.790
If your prep is SuTab, this video will walk you through exactly how to take

2
00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:04.560
it.

3
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.300
Just follow along step by step. Your SuTab kit includes two bottles of 12

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.160
tablets each and

5
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.920
a measured container. Start your first dose between 6 and 7 PM the night

6
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.320
before your procedure.

7
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:21.310
Open your first bottle of 12 tablets. Fill the provided container with 16

8
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:22.480
ounces of water up to

9
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:27.220
the fill line. Swallow one tablet every 2 minutes with a sip of water,

10
00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:28.400
finishing all 12 tablets over

11
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.390
about 15 to 20 minutes. Take your time and go at a steady pace. About 1 hour

12
00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:35.280
after your last tablet,

13
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.630
fill the container again with 16 ounces of water and drink the entire amount

14
00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:39.760
slowly over 30 minutes.

15
00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:44.080
Then about 30 minutes after finishing that container, fill it one more time

16
00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.520
with 16 ounces of water and

17
00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:50.240
drink the entire amount over 30 minutes. That completes your first dose. 7

18
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.760
hours prior to your

19
00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.480
procedure, repeat the exact same three steps using your second bottle of 12

20
00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:57.840
tablets. One tablet every

21
00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:02.560
2 minutes with water, then 16 ounces of water one hour later, then 16 ounces

22
00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:03.440
of water 30 minutes

23
00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:06.650
after that. This part is really important. You must drink all of the prep

24
00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:07.840
solution as directed,

25
00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:11.840
even if you're already passing clear liquid. I know it can feel like enough,

26
00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:12.480
but finishing the

27
00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.550
entire dose is what gives us the clearest view during your procedure. If the

28
00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:17.760
prep isn't completed

29
00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.460
as directed, we may need to reschedule and neither of us wants that. Between

30
00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:23.200
doses, keep drinking

31
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.680
clear liquids to stay hydrated. It will help you feel better and help the prep

32
00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:27.360
do its job.

33
00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:31.550
Do not drink anything at all within 4 hours of your procedure, including

34
00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:32.480
water unless it is a

35
00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:37.220
small sip to take a medication. Your procedure may be canceled or rescheduled

36
00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:38.640
if this is not followed.

37
00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:42.560
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

38
00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:43.520
a petroleum-based

39
00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:48.260
ointment or diaper rash cream can really help. That's it. You've got this.

40
00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:49.520
Follow the timing,

41
00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:54.240
finish the full dose, and stay hydrated. If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call

42
00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.240
our office. We're here to help.
